## Interface: 11200
## Title: BuffDaddy
## Notes: Raid/group buff tracker and reminder
## Author: Max

# Load order matters! Each file depends on the ones loaded before it.
# See the comment block at the top of each file for its specific dependencies.

# 1. Pure data - no dependencies on anything.
BuffDaddy_Definitions.lua

# 2. Namespace + constants - everything below depends on this existing.
BuffDaddy.lua

# 3. Roster gathering - depends on the BuffDaddy namespace.
BuffDaddy_Roster.lua

# 4. Buff checking logic - depends on Definitions + Roster.
BuffDaddy_Check.lua

# 5. Window/chat/whisper output - depends on Check's result format.
BuffDaddy_Output.lua

# 6. Minimap button + dropdown - triggers Check + Output, loads after both.
BuffDaddy_Minimap.lua

# 7. XML frames - referenced by the Lua files above (e.g. BuffDaddyWindowLine1,
#    BuffDaddy.Minimap.OnClick), loaded last so all those functions already exist.
BuffDaddy.xml
